3
00:00:02,943 --> 00:00:03,402
Meet Onto.

4
00:00:03,422 --> 00:00:04,951
One idea today:

5
00:00:04,971 --> 00:00:06,320
the key.

6
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,449
A key is the columns that name one row,

7
00:00:08,469 --> 00:00:09,642
and only one.

8
00:00:09,662 --> 00:00:10,407
For SAP order lines:

9
00:00:10,427 --> 00:00:11,272
client, order and item.

10
00:00:11,292 --> 00:00:13,056
MANDT + VBELN + POSNR.

11
00:00:13,076 --> 00:00:14,284
If a key repeats,

12
00:00:14,304 --> 00:00:16,334
every join on it repeats rows.

13
00:00:16,354 --> 00:00:17,852
In our SAP example,

14
00:00:17,872 --> 00:00:20,359
17 of 17 keys are unique.

15
00:00:20,649 --> 00:00:22,754
